::  name       mantra gen-floor pair gate
::  shape      [floor=@u32 gen=@u32] -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 while gen stays at or above floor; answers 0 when gen falls below
::  example    3 5 -> 1 · 3 2 -> 0 · 3 3 -> 1
::  readers    Mantra · Glow Tend · Ashvini · STOA346
::  nib        equinox-stoa346-mantra-pair-floor-v1
::
::  STOA346 — 2m mirror two. The a1 wall memorized the floor; here floor and
::  gen meet at runtime. The cond speaks in header order by the seated
::  grammar's law, so the floor stands first at the door.
|=  [floor=@u32 gen=@u32]
?:  (gth floor gen)  0  1
